How to run reduce easy way. (windows)
--------------------------------------

peter.vlasschaert@gmail.com , 15/02/2022

first download  : reduce (csl,psl)
=========================================

https://sourceforge.net/projects/reduce-algebra/postdownload

second download : run-reduce(version 3.0)
=========================================

info:https://fjwright.github.io/Run-REDUCE/
https://sourceforge.net/projects/reduce-algebra/files/latest/download


install : combination of two above
==================================
step 1: install reduce       'exmample :c:\math '
step 2: install run-reduce   'default directory '

configure installation :win-reduce (run : csl'reduce')
======================================================
step 1:run win-reduce
step 2:Menu -> REDUCE -> Configure Reduce
step 3:see :finalrunreduce3.png
step 4: doesn't work, Menu -> REDUCE -> ' configure : select auto,run : csl '